  "description": "A multimodal neuroimaging dataset combining simultaneous EEG and functional near-infrared spectroscopy (fNIRS) recordings from patients undergoing general anesthesia. This dataset provides concurrent measurements of electrical brain activity and cerebral hemodynamics during anesthetic induction and maintenance, enabling investigation of anesthesia-induced changes in brain function through complementary neurophysiological modalities.",
